    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/07d41e78cbd023bf773d99ecd82581aa.avif?t=1737013423\" width=600 height=214 /></span><br>&quot;EternalDreamland&quot; is a third-person beautiful girl shooter development game.<br>There is only one person in the studio, I am still working hard to improve and optimize, I hope to be more understanding and tolerant, thank you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background of the story</h2>The heroine is a 19-year-old high school student in the countryside, and after the end comes, she loses most of it<br>Memory, but she still remembers Hair Little Ruth, Senior Sister Hannah, and<br>And take refuge in Ruth's villa, in order to find his former friends, in a constant cycle with mutated creatures<br>Fight, rely on zombies to generate electricity, collect supplies, and fulfill their promise: go to the eternal city together!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>-The heroine goes alone to find her former friends and takes them to a shelter<br>- The backpack can be opened at any time to change (obtained) clothing<br>- Explore freely, collect supplies, build and upgrade shelters, interact with friends and rest in shelters, etc<br>- Compatible mobile phones, computers<br>- Yoga, Dancing, Going to bed, Bathroom, <strong> Restore blood volume, reduce infection value</strong><br>- Weapon attachments that can be used after unlocking, liveries<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/5f6456bef486d1da1ff94c86c67ba7e9.poster.avif?t=1737013423\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/5f6456bef486d1da1ff94c86c67ba7e9.webm?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/5f6456bef486d1da1ff94c86c67ba7e9.mp4?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight enemies in close combat, capture zombies, and maintain the power of your shelter with zombie power generation<br>- Hand-to-hand combat increases the infection value even more<br>- Upgrade to increase the infection value and HP limit<br>- Random weather, dynamic time<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/c77bc641e43b8f3da33e575d823b9ee5.poster.avif?t=1737013423\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/c77bc641e43b8f3da33e575d823b9ee5.webm?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/c77bc641e43b8f3da33e575d823b9ee5.mp4?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Kill enemies or be executed (can be turned off)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/289b8df31c7c6b4550e0760531dc6783.poster.avif?t=1737013423\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/289b8df31c7c6b4550e0760531dc6783.webm?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/289b8df31c7c6b4550e0760531dc6783.mp4?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the plan</h2>There is no trading system for the time being, and clothing or items cannot be sold, and the friend APP in the mobile phone<br> is an illustrated book, which may follow<br>Add a friend's dress-up, a friend's diary or career, and a friend's collectibles, which are not available in the current version<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/efa7d470e0cf60ec9d97050c365d8d52.poster.avif?t=1737013423\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/efa7d470e0cf60ec9d97050c365d8d52.webm?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722270/extras/efa7d470e0cf60ec9d97050c365d8d52.mp4?t=1737013423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Indie game developer</h2>Passionate about the game and wanting to create a better virtual world!<br>Hope you enjoy this game!",
